# Activity events: daftar tunggal + payload beku (pola #94/#102)

Feed publik dibangun dari tabel `activity_events`. Setiap kind harus terdaftar
di **empat tempat sekaligus** (satu sesi kerja, jangan menunda):

1. `ACTIVITY_EVENT_KINDS` + `announcementDedupeKey`-style helper —
   `src/modules/activity/domain/entities/activity-event.entity.ts`
2. `kindToWire` / `KIND_BODY` / `targetFor` / `buildItem` —
   `src/modules/activity/infrastructure/activity-event-feed.repository.impl.ts`
3. `ActivityKind` union + field wire —
   `src/modules/activity/domain/entities/activity-item.entity.ts`
   dan `toWire` di `presentation/v1/activity.controller.ts`
4. Tabel daftar event di `AGENTS.md` root + `docs/api/37-api-activity-feed.md`
   (+ `docs/mobile/23-...` bila mobile ikut render).

Wajib:

- **Payload beku (#94)**: copy yang bergantung state saat kejadian disimpan
  JSON di `activity_events.payload` saat write — feed membaca payload, tidak
  kalkulasi live read-time. Update entitas = re-publish copy dengan dedupe
  key sama; delete = soft delete + hide event (pola #56), tidak pernah
  `DELETE` baris feed.
- **Tabel baru ikut `truncateAll`** (`src/shared/database/drizzle/test-utils.ts`)
  — sebelum `users` bila ada FK `created_by` (race parallel truncate).
- ** JOIN, bukan N+1** saat membaca feed (rule `join-bukan-n-panggilan.mdc`).
- Mapper klien hanya parse field kind-tersebut saat `kind` cocok; tanpa
  payload item tetap tayang (fallback), tidak di-drop.

Contoh implementasi lengkap: modul `announcement` (#102) — write-through event
+ gate role root/admin + whitelist host `action_url` (https saja) di
`announcement.validator.ts` + keyset cursor ULID `before` (tanpa offset).
